    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>The Payment Gateway Remise for WooCommerce plugin adds the functionality to take Remise payments on your store of WooCommerce.</p>\n<h4>About Remise</h4>\n<p>Remise is a comprehensive payment platform that offers various online payment methods, such as credit card payment and convenience store payment in Japan.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.remise.jp/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Remise</a></p>\n<p>In order to use Remise, you have to purchase the authentication key at the following site.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.wpmarket.jp/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">WordPress Market</a></p>\n<h3>Known Issues / Bugs</h3>\n<p>Nothing.</p>\n<h3>Uninstall</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Deactivate the plugin</li>\n<li>That&#8217;s it! 🙂</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin file in the plugin install page or copy the <code>wc-remise-gateway</code> directory into your <code>wp-content/plugins</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n<li>That&#8217;s it! 🙂</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "<p>Nothing.</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Checkout Blocks.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.1.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Bugfix: IP address check.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Support for High-Performance Order Storage.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
